-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/7: יישום רפורמת "עוז לתמורה" ביישום חלקי וביישום מלא
-- The covering letter of the circular on carrying out the Oz LaTmura reform in
-- full and partial implementation. The document holds only the cover: the
-- full circular ("לצפיה בחוזר המלא") and its annexes of work-week tables are
-- linked, not printed, and the corpus carries their titles alone (a corpus
-- defect: the instructions themselves are not in it). So nothing here can be
-- priced or obliged; the file records what the cover states.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/7 יישום רפורמת "עוז לתמורה" ביישום חלקי וביישום מלא`

-- The corpus publishes this circular's letterhead, title, date (6.12.2011)
-- and addressee as body paragraphs of an untitled block (hc_1).
-- akn:hc_1/p1 The letterhead ("מדינת ישראל"); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 The letterhead (the Ministry); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 The letterhead (the teaching-staff administration); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p4 The letterhead (the senior division of teaching personnel); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 The circular's title; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p6 The Hebrew date; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p7 The date, 06/12/2011; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p8 The addressee, the owners of secondary educational institutions; no rule.

@desc The two ways the Oz LaTmura reform is carried out in a school.
DECLARE `implementation` IS ONE OF
    `full implementation`
    `partial implementation`

@desc The agreement the circular carries out, as the cover describes it.
DECLARE `reform agreement` HAS
    `signed on`                          IS A STRING
    `between`                            IS A LIST OF STRING
    `approved by the Wage Commissioner`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `covers`                             IS A STRING

-- The cover's three paragraphs: the agreement of 14.8.2011 between the
-- Centre of Local Government and the three big cities and the secondary
-- teachers' organisation, approved by the Wage Commissioner, on the reform
-- in the upper divisions and on all their teaching staff; the circular's
-- purpose is instructions for both full and partial implementation.
@ref akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10
`the agreement` MEANS
    `reform agreement` WITH
        `signed on`                         IS "14.8.2011"
        `between`                           IS LIST "מרכז השלטון המקומי ושלוש הערים הגדולות", "ארגון המורים העל-יסודיים"
        `approved by the Wage Commissioner` IS TRUE
        `covers`                            IS "the Oz LaTmura reform in the upper divisions, and all teaching staff of the upper divisions"

@ref akn:hc_1/p11
`the implementations the full circular instructs on` MEANS LIST `full implementation`, `partial implementation`

#ASSERT count `the implementations the full circular instructs on` EQUALS 2

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the sign-off and signature, the link to the full circular and to the Oz LaTmura agreement; the instructions are behind the link and not in the document.

-- akn:att_6__hc_1 The tail of annex א'-1's title (work-week tables for mothers in partial implementation, 2011/12); the table is not in the document.
-- akn:att_7__hc_1 The tail of annex א'-2's title (the same, 2012/13); the table is not in the document.
-- akn:att_8__hc_1 The tail of annex א'-3's title (the same, 2013/14); the table is not in the document.
-- akn:att_12__hc_1 The title of the work-week table for a deputy principal under Oz LaTmura; the table is not in the document.
